message: >-
  If you use CONDUCTOR, please cite the paper describing it. If you use the CIM layer, or the answer checks that
  read it, please also cite the CIM layer paper listed under references.
title: CONDUCTOR
abstract: >-
  An LLM-orchestrated digital twin for distribution grid operations, which reads the network through a Common
  Information Model (CIM) layer.
